{"sha": "d328f4e7d50c5a0c05aa48f655d3a8ab83f6bc28bea274422a64b924d38463c9", "body": ["{\\small 冷玻璃杯放在蜡烛上方时会起雾：燃烧的石蜡", "会产生水蒸气。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[木柴会变成什么]\\label{ex:g4:what-a-fire-needs:log}", "一根重几千克的木柴燃烧后，只剩下一小堆灰烬。", "大部分木材并没有消失：它与空气中的氧气结合，", "变成了烟、二氧化碳和水蒸气，这些都是气体，", "飘散到空中。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{灭火}", "", "\\begin{method}[灭火：去掉一个要素]\\label{met:g4:what-a-fire-needs:out}", "要灭火，就要去掉燃烧三要素中的一个：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\textbf{隔绝氧气}：用灭火毯、锅盖或沙子盖住火焰，", "        使空气无法接触火焰；", "  \\item \\textbf{带走热量}：向燃烧的木材或纸张上浇水，", "        使其温度降到无法继续燃烧的程度以下；", "  \\item \\textbf{移走燃料}：关掉煤气阀门，或清除", "        森林火灾周围的干枯植物。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, scale=0.7]", "  \\foreach \\k/\\lab/\\side in {0/{a blanket: no oxygen}/1, 1/{water: no heat}/2,", "                              2/{gas turned off: no fuel}/0} {", "    \\begin{scope}[xshift=\\k*6.2cm]", "      \\coordinate (A) at (0,0); \\coordinate (B) at (4,0); \\coordinate (C) at (2,3.3);", "      \\pgfmathsetmacro\\oa{\\side==0 ? 0.2 : 1}", "      \\pgfmathsetmacro\\ob{\\side==1 ? 0.2 : 1}", "      \\pgfmathsetmacro\\oc{\\side==2 ? 0.2 : 1}", "      \\draw[line width=2.5pt, brown!70!black, opacity=\\oa] (A) -- (B);", "      \\draw[line width=2.5pt, omDef, opacity=\\ob] (B) -- (C);", "      \\draw[line width=2.5pt, red!75!black, opacity=\\oc] (C) -- (A);", "      \\ifnum\\side=0 \\draw[line width=1.4pt, black] (1.6,-0.4) -- (2.4,0.4) (1.6,0.4) -- (2.4,-0.4);\\fi", "      \\ifnum\\side=1 \\draw[line width=1.4pt, black] (2.6,1.25) -- (3.4,2.05) (2.6,2.05) -- (3.4,1.25);\\fi", "      \\ifnum\\side=2 \\draw[line width=1.4pt, black] (0.6,1.25) -- (1.4,2.05) (0.6,2.05) -- (1.4,1.25);\\fi", "      \\node[align=center, anchor=north] at (2,-0.6) {\\lab};", "    \\end{scope}", "  }", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 三种灭火方法，每种各去掉燃烧三角形中的一边", "（图中打叉的部分）：氧气、热量或燃料。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.48\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth,height=4.6cm,keepaspectratio]{images/book1/ai/g4-fire-blanket.jpg}", "", "{\\small 灭火毯盖在平底锅上：空气无法再接触", "火焰。}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.48\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth,height=4.6cm,keepaspectratio]{images/book1/ai/g4-firefighters.jpg}", "", "{\\small 消防员向燃烧的棚屋喷水降温。}", "\\end{minipage}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{火灾安全}", "", "\\begin{remark}[油锅着火时绝不能浇水]\\label{rem:g4:what-a-fire-needs:oil}", "若煎锅中的油着火，任何人都不能向锅里泼水，", "因为水会立即在油层下沸腾，把燃烧的油溅出锅外。", "应由成年人关闭煤气或电炉，并用锅盖或灭火毯", "盖住油锅。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{safety}{\\ghs{GHS02}\\ghs{GHS04}}", "% ledger: ghs:butane", "打火机或露营气罐中的气体是丁烷。其火焰", "图标（GHS02）表示：极易燃，远离火焰与", "火花。气瓶图标（GHS04）表示：", "气体处于高压之下。", "\\end{safety}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[发生火灾时怎么办]\\label{prop:g4:what-a-fire-needs:safety}", "烟雾是火灾中的第一大危险：它有高温，会遮住逃生的路，", "且吸入有毒。天花板上的烟雾报警器", "一遇到烟雾就会大声鸣叫。若发生火灾：迅速撤离，", "在烟雾下方低身前行，随手关上身后的门，并在", "屋外拨打消防电话。千万不要再返回屋内。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.42\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g4-smoke-alarm.jpg}", "", "{\\small 烟雾报警器：一遇到烟雾就会鸣响。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g4:what-a-fire-needs:1}", "说出燃烧三要素。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g4:what-a-fire-needs:2}", "下列物质中哪些是燃料：木材、沙子、石蜡、玻璃、汽油、水、", "纸张？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g4:what-a-fire-needs:3}", "将灭火毯盖在一小团火上，它去掉了", "燃烧三要素中的哪一个？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}